              "content": "=Analyze this customer's health data and provide churn risk assessment:\n\n*Customer:* {{ $json.name }} ({{ $json.id }})\n*Account Type:* {{ $json.accountType }}\n*Contract Value:* ${{ $json.contractValue }}\n*Health Score:* {{ $json.healthScore }}/100\n*Status:* {{ $json.healthStatus }}\n\n*Health Factors:*\n{{ $json.healthFactors.join('\\n') }}\n\n*Metrics:*\n- Usage Rate: {{ $json.usageRate }}%\n- Last Login: {{ $json.lastLoginDays }} days ago\n- Open Tickets: {{ $json.openTickets }}\n- NPS Score: {{ $json.npsScore }}\n- Contract Growth: {{ $json.contractGrowth }}%\n\nProvide JSON with:\n{\n  \"churnRisk\": \"low|medium|high|critical\",\n  \"churnProbability\": 0-100,\n  \"keyRisks\": [\"list of specific risks\"],\n  \"recommendedActions\": [\"prioritized action items\"],\n  \"talkingPoints\": [\"for CSM call\"],\n  \"upsellOpportunities\": [\"if healthy\"]\n}"
